// Hand-written monitor tweaks.
//
// The geometry (mode, scale, position) does not live here: nwg-displays
// generates it in monitor.kdl, which config.kdl includes before this file.
// monitor.kdl depends on the monitors attached to this machine and on the
// connectors the kernel assigns them, so it is excluded from the repo.
//
// niri merges output blocks with the same name instead of replacing them:
// only the keys nwg-displays cannot write are needed here, and the geometry
// stays the one it wrote. Verified: with this file reduced to just
// focus-at-startup, DP-3 keeps its position and scale.
//
// The big monitor's connector changes depending on the port used: it was
// DP-2 and is now DP-3. If the initial focus ever lands on the wrong screen,
// this is the name to update.

// LG HDR 4K: this is the main monitor, focus starts on it.
output "DP-3" {
    focus-at-startup
}
